# native build output (regenerate with `npx expo prebuild`)
# Anchored to the repo root with a leading slash: a bare `android/`
# would also ignore nested native module dirs such as
# modules/liquid-glass-refraction/android/, which must be committed
# or the module's Kotlin never reaches CI and autolinking drops it.
/android/
/ios/

